      "words": "Attaching screenshots of Carmine Penta with maxed Primed Firestorm as you requested. Second image has 261, 190, 226, 137 and 76. Third image has 170, 256, 112 and 220. Did a fourth and it has 229, 259, 179, 127 and 68 yellow."
